{"type": "tool_call", "n": 11, "ts": 1790154274.4320269, "tool": "submit_memo", "args": {"text": "DE MARCH 2026 CUTOFF & JOURNAL ENTRY REVIEW\nDate: 2026-04-03\nReviewer: Senior Accountant\n\nSUMMARY\nReviewed all 28 March 2026 entries for DE. Identified 2 critical issues requiring controller escalation.\n\nISSUES IDENTIFIED & ACTIONS TAKEN:\n\n1. UNSUPPORTED REVENUE ENTRY - EXC-001\n   Entry: JE-00298\n   Date: 2026-03-29 23:47\n   Description: \"Umsatzkorrektur Q1\" (Q1 revenue correction)\n   Amount: EUR 9,999.00\n   Issue: Posted without any supporting documentation\n   Posted By: m.krause\n   Action: Flagged for controller review - unable to substantiate\n\n2. PERIOD CUTOFF ERROR - EXC-002  \n   Entry: JE-00305 (now reversed as JE-00306)\n   Original Date: 2026-03-31\n   Supporting Doc: DOC-0206 (Invoice NW-2026-0402)\n   Amount: EUR 5,600.00\n   Issue: April invoice (dated 2026-04-02 for April 1-30 services) incorrectly posted in March\n   Action: Entry reversed from March. Cannot re-post to April as April 2026 period is not open. Flagged for controller decision on whether to re-post to April once period opens or handle as pending accrual.\n\nREMAINING MARCH ENTRIES\nAll other 26 entries reviewed and found to be properly supported and within normal cutoff parameters. AR, AP, payroll, and operating expenses all appear properly dated and substantiated.\n\nCHECKLIST STATUS\nMarked \"AP cutoff review\" as BLOCKED pending controller resolution of identified issues.\n\nRECOMMENDATION\nController review and approval required before March 2026 close can be locked:\n- Provide supporting documentation for JE-00298 or approve reversal\n- Authorize re-posting of Nordwolke invoice to April once that period opens (or confirm accrual treatment desired)"}, "is_error": false, "result": {"status": "memo submitted; task complete"}, "ms": 8}
